    "Buying a home": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprar una casa"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "买房"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By law you get the Closing Disclosure at least 3 business days before closing. Compare it line-by-line to your Loan Estimate and question anything that jumped.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por ley recibes el Closing Disclosure al menos 3 días hábiles antes del cierre. Compáralo línea por línea con tu Loan Estimate y cuestiona lo que haya subido."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按法律规定，过户至少 3 个工作日前你会收到《成交披露》（Closing Disclosure）。逐行与你的贷款估算单比较，对任何上涨的项目提出疑问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call and ask if they're taking new patients.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llama y pregunta si aceptan pacientes nuevos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打电话询问他们是否接收新患者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call or use the patient portal to book — new-patient slots can take weeks.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llama o usa el portal del paciente para reservar: los cupos para pacientes nuevos pueden tardar semanas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打电话或用患者门户预约——新患者的号可能要等几周。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call or use the patient portal to book your visit.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llama o usa el portal del paciente para reservar tu cita."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打电话或用患者门户预约你的就诊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call the police and file a report now — you'll need it for a hit-and-run claim. Note the report number.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llama a la policía y presenta un informe ahora: lo necesitarás para una reclamación por fuga. Anota el número del informe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即报警并备案——肇事逃逸理赔需要它。记下报告编号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call the police if anyone's hurt, damage is major, or your state requires it — note the report number.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llama a la policía si hay heridos, el daño es grave o tu estado lo exige; anota el número del informe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如有人受伤、损失严重或你所在州要求时，请报警——记下报告编号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call the title company to verify wire instructions before sending.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llama a la compañía de títulos para verificar las instrucciones antes de enviar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "汇款前致电产权公司核实汇款指示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call your insurer before the tow if you can — many policies include towing, and an approved shop avoids surprise fees. Don't let the car sit in a storage lot; storage fees add up daily.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si puedes, llama a tu aseguradora antes de la grúa: muchas pólizas incluyen remolque, y un taller aprobado evita cargos sorpresa. No dejes el auto en un depósito; las tarifas de almacenamiento se acumulan a diario."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以的话在拖车前先打给保险公司——很多保单包含拖车服务，拖到认可的修理厂能避免意外收费。别让车停在存放场；存放费每天都在累加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calling the insurer (yours or the at-fault driver's), have your details ready.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al llamar a la aseguradora (la tuya o la del culpable), ten tus datos listos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "致电保险公司（你的或责任方的）时，准备好你的信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
