          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查询我的案件状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the doctor is in-network for YOUR plan.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba que el médico esté en la red de TU plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认该医生在你这个计划的网络内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the federal trademark database.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consulta la base de datos federal de marcas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查询联邦商标数据库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the loan amount, interest rate, and monthly payment.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revisa el monto del préstamo, la tasa de interés y el pago mensual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核对贷款金额、利率和每月还款额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the name isn't already taken before you commit to it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba que el nombre no esté tomado antes de decidirte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在确定名称前，先确认它尚未被占用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the official USCIS N-400 eligibility page — many apply after 5 years as a permanent resident (3 in some marriage-based cases), but exceptions exist.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consulta la página oficial de elegibilidad del N-400 de USCIS: muchos solicitan tras 5 años como residente permanente (3 en algunos casos por matrimonio), pero hay excepciones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看 USCIS 官方 N-400 资格页面——许多人在成为永久居民 5 年后申请（部分基于婚姻的情况为 3 年），但也有例外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the steps and due date, then tap **Add to inbox** to save it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revisa los pasos y la fecha límite, y toca **Añadir a la bandeja** para guardarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查步骤和截止日期，然后点**添加到待办**保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the web domain and social handles are free.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba que el dominio web y los usuarios en redes estén libres."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认网域和社交账号名可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check their license on your state's real-estate board site.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifica su licencia en el sitio de la junta de bienes raíces de tu estado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你所在州的房地产管理机构网站核实其执照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check they're accepting new patients.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba que aceptan pacientes nuevos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认他们正在接收新患者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether you also need a state return — and if you moved or worked in another state, check both.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba si también necesitas una declaración estatal; si te mudaste o trabajaste en otro estado, revisa ambos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认你是否还需要报州税——如果你搬过家或在其他州工作过，两个州都要查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check your credit and set a budget, including the down payment and the monthly cost (loan, taxes, insurance).": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revisa tu crédito y define un presupuesto, incluyendo el pago inicial y el costo mensual (préstamo, impuestos, seguro)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查你的信用记录并制定预算，包括首付和每月支出（贷款、税费、保险）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check your doctors are in-network and your prescriptions are on the plan's drug list (formulary).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifica que tus médicos estén en la red y que tus recetas estén en la lista de medicamentos del plan (formulario)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认你的医生在网络内，你的处方药在计划的药品清单（formulary）上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
