          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cobertura del trabajo suele tener un plazo corto de inscripción: unos 30 días desde tu fecha de inicio. Si lo pierdes, quizá debas esperar a la inscripción abierta anual de la empresa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公司提供的保险通常有一个很短的参保窗口——从入职日起大约 30 天。错过就可能要等公司每年一次的公开参保期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just me (sole proprietor)": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo yo (empresario individual)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有我（个体经营）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just starting": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apenas empezando"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刚开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep every bill, record, and receipt — the claim can reimburse them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guarda cada factura, registro y recibo: el reclamo puede reembolsarlos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留每张账单、病历和收据——理赔可以报销这些费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep records: claim number, report number, estimates, medical bills.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guarda los registros: número de reclamación, número de informe, presupuestos y facturas médicas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存记录：理赔编号、报告编号、估价单、医疗账单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the inspection, financing, and appraisal contingencies — they let you back out safely if something goes wrong.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén las contingencias de inspección, financiamiento y avalúo: te permiten retirarte con seguridad si algo sale mal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留验房、贷款和估价这几项附加条件（contingencies）——出问题时它们让你安全退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your plan name, member ID, and the member-services phone number handy — they're all on your insurance card, and you'll need them at every doctor visit and pharmacy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten a mano el nombre de tu plan, tu número de miembro y el teléfono de servicio al miembro: todos están en tu tarjeta del seguro, y los necesitarás en cada visita al médico y en la farmacia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把你的保险计划名称、会员ID和会员服务电话放在手边——它们都在你的保险卡上，每次看病和去药房都会用到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Label": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etiqueta"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标签"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last year's return, if you have it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La declaración del año pasado, si la tienes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去年的报税表（如果有）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lease, deposit, utilities, insurance": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contrato, depósito, servicios, seguro"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "租约、押金、水电网、保险"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lender / loan #": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prestamista / n.º de préstamo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "贷款机构／贷款编号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lenders decide your rate from your credit and your debt-to-income — check your reports early so there's time to fix errors.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los prestamistas fijan tu tasa según tu crédito y tu relación deuda-ingresos; revisa tus informes con tiempo para corregir errores."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "贷款机构根据你的信用和债务收入比来定利率——尽早查信用报告，留出时间纠正错误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let's take a quick tour — add your first to-do and see how Tadah keeps you on track.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un recorrido rápido: añade tu primer pendiente y mira cómo Tadah te mantiene al día."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速看一遍怎么用——添加你的第一个待办，看看 Tadah 怎么帮你不错过任何事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LIBRARY": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BIBLIOTECA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指南库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life events come with a stack of paperwork. Pick a guide and Tadah walks you through it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los trámites de la vida traen mucho papeleo. Elige una guía y Tadah te acompaña paso a paso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人生大事总伴随成堆的文件。选择一个指南，Tadah 一步步带你完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life Guides & Checklists": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guías de vida paso a paso"
          }
        },
