          }
        }
      }
    },
    "List A (one): U.S. passport, OR permanent-resident card, OR a work permit.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lista A (uno): pasaporte de EE. UU., o tarjeta de residente permanente, o un permiso de trabajo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表 A（任选一）：美国护照，或永久居民卡，或工作许可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LLC": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LLC (sociedad de responsabilidad limitada)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LLC（有限责任公司）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LLC: file with the state; separates personal and business assets.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LLC: se registra ante el estado; separa los bienes personales y del negocio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LLC：向州登记；隔离个人与公司资产。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LOCAL OCR · NO BANK LINK · NO AUTOPAY": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OCR LOCAL · SIN BANCO · SIN PAGO AUTOMÁTICO"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机识别 · 不连银行 · 不自动扣款"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location, date/time, and weather.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lugar, fecha/hora y clima."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地点、日期／时间和天气。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for low or no monthly fees and a branch/ATM network near you.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Busca pocas o ninguna comisión mensual y una red de sucursales/cajeros cerca de ti."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "寻找月费低或免月费、且附近有网点／ATM 的银行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low income (Medicaid/CHIP)": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bajos ingresos (Medicaid/CHIP)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低收入（Medicaid/CHIP）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low income? Apply for Medicaid or CHIP any time of year — if approved, when coverage starts depends on your state.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Bajos ingresos? Solicita Medicaid o CHIP en cualquier momento del año; si te aprueban, cuándo empieza la cobertura depende de tu estado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低收入？可全年随时申请 Medicaid 或 CHIP——若获批，保障何时开始取决于你所在州。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Machine translation — double-check anything important against the original.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traducción automática: verifica lo importante comparándolo con el original."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "机器翻译——重要内容请与原件核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make an offer; once it's accepted, sign the purchase agreement and pay the earnest-money deposit.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haz una oferta; una vez aceptada, firma el contrato de compraventa y paga el depósito de garantía (earnest money)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提出报价；一旦被接受，签署购房合同并支付诚意金（earnest money）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many banks accept an ITIN or foreign passport instead of an SSN — call ahead to confirm.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muchos bancos aceptan un ITIN o un pasaporte extranjero en lugar del SSN; llama antes para confirmar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许多银行接受 ITIN 或外国护照代替 SSN——请提前致电确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many people can file federally for free; eligibility depends on income and situation.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muchas personas pueden declarar impuestos federales gratis; la elegibilidad depende de los ingresos y la situación."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "很多人可以免费报联邦税；是否符合条件取决于收入和具体情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mark as not done": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marcar como no hecho"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标记为未完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mark done": {
      "localizations": {
