        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相关的既往病历或检查结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pay any fee (some categories are fee-exempt) and do biometrics if scheduled.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paga la tarifa que corresponda (algunas categorías están exentas) y haz los datos biométricos si te los programan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缴纳任何费用（部分类别免费），如安排了生物识别就去办。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pay by a traceable method — a check or bank transfer, not cash without a receipt — and get a dated receipt. It's your proof when it's time to get the deposit back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paga por un método rastreable —cheque o transferencia bancaria, no efectivo sin recibo— y consigue un recibo con fecha. Es tu comprobante cuando llegue el momento de recuperar el depósito."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用可追溯的方式付款——支票或银行转账，别用没有收据的现金——并拿到写明日期的收据。这是你日后要回押金时的凭证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pay quarterly estimated taxes (federal, and state if it has income tax).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paga los impuestos estimados trimestrales (federales, y estatales si tu estado tiene impuesto sobre la renta)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按季度缴纳预估税（联邦税，以及如果你所在州有所得税，还有州税）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pay the fee; go to a biometrics appointment if one is scheduled.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paga la tarifa; acude a la cita de datos biométricos si te la programan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缴费；如安排了生物识别预约，请前往。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pay the filing fee and submit.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
