    },
    "Submit your SSN, bank, and ID only through the official HR portal — never by email or text.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envía tu SSN, datos bancarios e identificación solo por el portal oficial de RR. HH., nunca por correo o mensaje."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只通过官方 HR 门户提交你的 SSN、银行和身份信息——绝不要用电邮或短信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summary": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resumen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摘要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah": {},
    "Tadah is informational only — not legal, tax, immigration, financial, or medical advice. It uses AI, which can make mistakes; please double-check important details with official sources or a professional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah es solo informativo: no constituye asesoramiento legal, fiscal, migratorio, financiero ni médico. Usa IA, que puede cometer errores; verifica los datos importantes con fuentes oficiales o un profesional."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah 仅供参考——不构成法律、税务、移民、金融或医疗建议。它使用 AI，可能会出错；请向官方来源或专业人士核对重要信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah reminds you before it's due so you don't forget.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah te avisa antes del vencimiento para que no lo olvides."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah 会在到期前提醒你，免得忘记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah turns a confusing bill or letter into simple steps like these.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah convierte una factura o carta confusa en pasos simples como estos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah 把看不懂的账单或信件变成像这样的简单步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadah works by reminding you before a bill, appointment, or form is due. Turn on notifications so those reminders can actually reach you — without them, Tadah can't nudge you in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah te avisa antes de que venza una factura, cita o formulario. Activa las notificaciones para que esos recordatorios te lleguen; sin ellas, Tadah no puede avisarte a tiempo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadah 会在账单、预约或表格到期前提醒你。请打开通知，这些提醒才能及时送达——否则 Tadah 无法及时提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the Oath of Allegiance at your ceremony.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presta el Juramento de Lealtad en tu ceremonia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在仪式上宣读效忠誓词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Add** below — that's where new to-dos start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca **Añadir** abajo: ahí empiezan los nuevos pendientes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点下方的**添加**——新的待办都从这里开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap ＋ Add to scan a document — Tadah explains it and what to do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca ＋ Añadir para escanear un documento: Tadah lo explica y te dice qué hacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按 ＋ 添加 来扫描文件 — Tadah 会解释它是什么以及该怎么做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap ＋ below, then Scan — Tadah explains it and builds your steps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca ＋ abajo y elige Escanear — Tadah lo explica y crea tus pasos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点下方的＋，选择扫描——Tadah 帮你看懂并生成步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap one to open it, or swipe it left to mark it done. You're all set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca uno para abrirlo o deslízalo a la izquierda para marcarlo hecho. ¡Todo listo!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一下打开，向左滑标记完成。就这么简单！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the box to check off a step as you finish it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca la casilla para marcar cada paso al terminarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成一步后，点按方框打勾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to enlarge": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
