            "value": "点按填写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tax forms, pay, benefits — W-2 or 1099": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Formularios fiscales, pago, beneficios: W-2 o 1099"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "税表、薪资、福利——W-2 或 1099"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tax guide": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guía de impuestos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报税指南"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taxes withheld — federal, state, Social Security, and Medicare.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los impuestos retenidos: federal, estatal, Seguro Social y Medicare."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预扣的税款——联邦税、州税、社会安全税（Social Security）和医疗保险税（Medicare）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell them it was a car accident, so it's in the record.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diles que fue un accidente de auto, para que quede en el expediente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉医生这是车祸受伤，让它记录在案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temporal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "临时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms & Disclaimers": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Términos y descargos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "条款与免责声明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service is busy or this device hit its limit — please try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servicio de IA está ocupado o este dispositivo alcanzó su límite — inténtalo más tarde."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 服务繁忙或本设备已达使用上限——请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The deposit amount — and exactly what you must do to get it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El monto del depósito, y exactamente qué debes hacer para recuperarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "押金金额——以及要拿回押金你到底得做些什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The insurance company bills you directly for this first payment — not HealthCare.gov — so watch for that first bill (mail, email, or their site) and pay by the due date, or your start date won't stick.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La compañía de seguros te cobra directamente este primer pago —no HealthCare.gov—, así que está atento a esa primera factura (correo, email o su sitio web) y paga antes de la fecha límite, o tu fecha de inicio no quedará firme."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这第一笔付款由保险公司直接向你收取——不是 HealthCare.gov——所以要留意第一张账单（邮寄、电子邮件或他们的网站），并在到期日前付清，否则你的保险生效日期就不作数了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The insurer usually inspects the damage — an adjuster visit or photos you upload — before approving repairs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La aseguradora suele inspeccionar el daño —una visita del ajustador o fotos que subes— antes de aprobar las reparaciones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险公司通常会先查勘损失——理赔员上门或让你上传照片——然后才批准维修。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lease is a binding contract — once you sign, its terms hold. Read every line and ask about anything unclear before you sign. If a promise isn't written in the lease, it doesn't count.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El contrato de arrendamiento es vinculante: una vez que firmas, sus términos rigen. Lee cada línea y pregunta por cualquier cosa que no entiendas antes de firmar. Si una promesa no está escrita en el contrato, no cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "租约是有约束力的合同——一旦签字，条款就生效。签字前逐条阅读，任何不清楚的地方都要问。没有写进租约的承诺，都不算数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The money landed in the right bank account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El dinero llegó a la cuenta bancaria correcta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钱打进了正确的银行账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other driver hit me": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El otro conductor me chocó"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方司机撞了我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The police report number, if you have one.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El número del informe policial, si lo tienes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警方报告编号（如果有）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scanned photo is kept on the saved item so you can check the original anytime — it stays on your device. Turn off to stop saving photos for new scans.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La foto escaneada se guarda con el elemento para que puedas consultar el original cuando quieras — permanece en tu dispositivo. Desactívalo para no guardar fotos en los nuevos escaneos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描的照片会保存在事项里，方便你随时查看原件——照片只保存在你的手机上。关闭后，新的扫描将不再保存照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their insurance company and policy number.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su compañía de seguros y número de póliza."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方的保险公司和保单号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a repeating task": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta es una tarea que se repite"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一个重复任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This scan has several items. Pick which to add — you can edit each one afterward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este escaneo tiene varios elementos. Elige cuáles añadir — puedes editar cada uno después."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这次扫描包含多个项目。选择要添加的项 — 之后可逐个编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sets the language Tadah uses to explain your documents (it defaults to your phone's language). The app itself follows your phone's language. A few sensitive guides — money, immigration, medical — stay in English on your device.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto define el idioma con que Tadah explica tus documentos (por defecto, el de tu teléfono). La app en sí sigue el idioma de tu teléfono. Algunas guías sensibles —dinero, inmigración, médico— se quedan en inglés y en tu dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里设置 Tadah 解释你文件时使用的语言（默认与手机语言一致）。应用本身会跟随手机语言。少数敏感指南（财务、移民、医疗）会保留英文并仅存于你的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This task repeats — deleting it also stops future ones.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta tarea se repite — al eliminarla también se detienen las futuras."
