        }
      }
    },
    "Tow to a repair shop or your home — not a storage lot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remolca a un taller o a tu casa, no a un depósito."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖到修理厂或你家——不要拖到存放场。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Track your case and watch for your EAD card in the mail.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigue tu caso y está atento a tu tarjeta EAD por correo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟踪你的案件，并留意邮寄到的 EAD 工卡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Track your case online until the new card arrives.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigue tu caso en línea hasta que llegue la nueva tarjeta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线跟踪你的案件，直到新卡寄到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Track your income and business expenses — expenses lower what you owe.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lleva un registro de tus ingresos y gastos del negocio: los gastos reducen lo que debes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录你的收入和业务支出——支出能降低你要缴的税。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transferring? Ask the old school to send records (transcripts, and an IEP/504 plan if any).": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Te trasladas? Pide a la escuela anterior que envíe los expedientes (notas y el plan IEP/504, si lo hay)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转学？请原学校转送记录（成绩单，以及 IEP/504 计划（如有））。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
